WEBVTT

01:31.699 --> 01:37.189
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.189 --> 01:39.492
[Episode 3]

01:42.139 --> 01:43.492
Your Highness, this way please.

01:47.859 --> 01:50.779
Your Highness, this is your room.

01:51.419 --> 01:53.180
All the furnishings in the room

01:53.180 --> 01:55.460
are all crafted by my son.

01:55.460 --> 01:57.020
We only wish you

01:57.020 --> 01:58.139
to feel at home.

02:03.940 --> 02:05.660
My favorite glazed cup,

02:05.660 --> 02:06.859
vase

02:06.859 --> 02:08.300
and handwarmer.

02:08.300 --> 02:09.580
It's been so long,

02:10.099 --> 02:11.379
yet he still remembers.

02:13.619 --> 02:15.219
The curtains in the room

02:15.219 --> 02:16.580
are also chosen by Zishu

02:16.580 --> 02:18.740
for you, Your Highness.

02:18.740 --> 02:20.420
Zishu keeps

02:20.980 --> 02:23.180
all your preferences all in mind.

02:24.580 --> 02:27.619
Finding Shuiyu curtains in Luoyang

02:27.619 --> 02:28.700
is truly hard.

02:29.219 --> 02:30.339
Zishu is really thoughtful.

02:34.779 --> 02:36.339
Was this also chosen by Zishu?

02:37.779 --> 02:40.379
Zishu's father saw the items Zishu has chosen

02:40.379 --> 02:42.539
are elegant yet lack nobility,

02:42.539 --> 02:45.059
therefore, he added a few items.

02:45.059 --> 02:46.099
This gold and jade Ruyi…

02:46.099 --> 02:47.332
Take it away.

02:48.219 --> 02:49.604
Yes.

02:50.900 --> 02:52.819
Servants, remove it.

02:52.819 --> 02:54.180
- Hurry.
- Yes.

03:04.339 --> 03:05.700
Madame Liu.

03:05.700 --> 03:07.779
The jade pillow on this bed is precious,

03:07.779 --> 03:09.180
it is too cold and hard.

03:09.180 --> 03:10.700
County Princess uses a medicinal pillow.

03:11.420 --> 03:13.460
The silk quilt on the bed is too thin as well.

03:13.460 --> 03:15.099
County Princess's body is fragile,

03:15.099 --> 03:17.300
can only sleep on an extremely soft bed.

03:18.460 --> 03:19.779
Your Highness.

03:19.779 --> 03:22.020
Zishu does not understand
the items used in a lady's room,

03:22.619 --> 03:24.740
so I took the liberty of deciding for myself.

03:24.740 --> 03:26.700
But I've never thought to make such mistakes.

03:27.300 --> 03:28.580
Please spare me.

03:28.580 --> 03:29.659
I will

03:29.659 --> 03:31.099
have it replaced immediately.

03:33.059 --> 03:34.260
Your Highness, are you feeling cold?

03:46.860 --> 03:48.499
It is late spring in Luoyang,

03:48.499 --> 03:49.499
but it's still a bit chilling.

03:50.260 --> 03:51.939
The window screens of this room are thick,

03:51.939 --> 03:53.219
blocking out all the sunlight.

03:54.140 --> 03:55.939
County Princess

03:55.939 --> 03:58.180
has been already tired from the journey,

03:58.180 --> 03:59.580
and got frightened at the floral banquet.

04:00.099 --> 04:02.140
How can she stay in
such a cold and gloomy room?

04:03.860 --> 04:05.460
I beg your forgiveness.

04:05.460 --> 04:06.779
It is my oversight.

04:07.740 --> 04:08.860
My son

04:08.860 --> 04:10.420
has specially prepared

04:10.420 --> 04:13.740
a jasmine pearl soup for you
to relieve fatigue and warm the body.

04:13.740 --> 04:14.779
Your Highness,

04:14.779 --> 04:16.580
please go to the side hall to take a sip.

04:16.580 --> 04:17.859
Just wait a moment.

04:18.580 --> 04:21.299
I will immediately help you
arrange a better room.

04:22.299 --> 04:23.820
No need.

04:24.700 --> 04:26.419
I am fully aware of

04:26.419 --> 04:27.739
the mansion

04:27.739 --> 04:29.252
of a Deputy Fifth-Rank official.

04:29.779 --> 04:31.219
I presume this is

04:31.219 --> 04:32.460
the best wing-room here.

04:33.419 --> 04:35.820
We have brought with us the daily supplies.

04:35.820 --> 04:37.299
Just change them.

04:37.299 --> 04:39.419
Don't make Zishu's kindness go in vain.

04:40.419 --> 04:42.380
Yes, I'll do it right away.

04:47.979 --> 04:49.820
Thank you for your understanding,
Your Highness.

04:50.779 --> 04:51.900
This wing-room

04:51.900 --> 04:54.260
is right next to Zishu's courtyard.

04:54.260 --> 04:56.739
It's very convenient for getting around.

04:57.339 --> 04:58.900
If you need anything,

04:58.900 --> 05:00.299
please let him know.

05:01.060 --> 05:02.620
The banquet has already ended.

05:03.140 --> 05:04.820
Has Zishu not finished
seeing off the guests yet?

05:11.620 --> 05:12.964
Rou.

05:15.099 --> 05:17.380
The County Princess's wing-room
has been tidied up already.

05:17.380 --> 05:18.779
What are you doing?

05:18.779 --> 05:19.859
My lord.

05:19.859 --> 05:21.940
County Princess is dissatisfied
with the furnishings in the room,

05:21.940 --> 05:23.020
and thus has sent someone

05:23.020 --> 05:25.099
to fetch her own belongings for replacement.

05:38.700 --> 05:40.580
Today, there is an event of negligence here.

05:41.299 --> 05:42.339
If Zishu didn't

05:42.339 --> 05:44.060
beg on his knees for mercy for the Liu family,

05:45.179 --> 05:47.620
this matter certainly
could not be easily glossed over.

05:48.739 --> 05:50.339
If such negligence

05:50.339 --> 05:52.140
had occurred in Chang'an,

05:52.700 --> 05:53.940
everyone in the Liu Mansion

05:54.620 --> 05:56.179
would all face the death penalty.

05:58.779 --> 06:00.419
Such a mistake that has occurred

06:00.979 --> 06:03.060
is all due to the incapability of Madam He.

06:04.219 --> 06:05.820
What a disaster that the Liu family

06:06.859 --> 06:08.140
has such a daughter-in-law.

06:09.500 --> 06:11.659
Everyone knows

06:12.419 --> 06:13.940
that since she married into the Liu family,

06:13.940 --> 06:16.260
she has never been favored by Zishu.

06:16.260 --> 06:17.580
The duty to manage the family

06:17.580 --> 06:19.940
would never fall into her hand,
the daughter of a merchant.

06:20.460 --> 06:21.700
The place where she lives

06:21.700 --> 06:22.979
is remote.

06:22.979 --> 06:24.580
So she will certainly not bother you.

06:25.179 --> 06:27.099
You protect her like this,

06:27.859 --> 06:29.900
making me the one who is annoying.

06:29.900 --> 06:31.739
Your Highness, you got me wrong.

06:31.739 --> 06:33.060
I'm afraid that woman

06:33.060 --> 06:34.339
will bother you.

06:34.900 --> 06:36.580
Master Liu was demoted
and transferred to Luoyang,

06:37.179 --> 06:39.339
willingly degrades himself and makes
a marriage alliance to a merchant family.

06:39.900 --> 06:42.380
He has been ups and downs
in his official career for a full three years.

06:43.140 --> 06:44.460
And now, he is still

06:44.460 --> 06:46.620
a minor regency official,

06:46.620 --> 06:49.179
causing Zishu to be unable
to even be an inherited official.

06:49.179 --> 06:50.700
He can only study hard

06:50.700 --> 06:51.820
for the Imperial Exam with great effort.

06:52.419 --> 06:53.859
He is such a man of talent and value,

06:53.859 --> 06:55.260
has fallen to such a state.

06:56.419 --> 06:57.979
Do you really believe

06:57.979 --> 06:59.900
the assets from the He family

07:00.580 --> 07:02.219
could make him rise rapidly through the ranks?

07:03.260 --> 07:04.900
Your Highness.

07:04.900 --> 07:06.419
You are right.

07:07.460 --> 07:09.460
We have held back Zishu.

07:10.020 --> 07:11.380
For Zishu,

07:11.380 --> 07:12.979
I will not tell my father

07:12.979 --> 07:14.779
about the assassination attempt.

07:15.900 --> 07:17.179
However,

07:17.179 --> 07:19.620
the servants are so incompetent,

07:19.620 --> 07:20.620
must be punished.

07:21.419 --> 07:23.620
All the servants at today's floral banquet

07:23.620 --> 07:25.419
receive eighty strokes of the cane
as punishment.

07:26.099 --> 07:27.620
Madam He failed to notice it,

07:27.620 --> 07:29.979
and receive forty strokes of the cane
as punishment.

07:30.700 --> 07:32.260
Your Highness, please spare us.

07:32.940 --> 07:33.940
Madam He failed to notice it,

07:34.500 --> 07:36.539
and will be surely dealt with by us
according to family discipline.

07:36.539 --> 07:37.940
And we won't let off the servants

07:37.940 --> 07:38.940
who deserve punishment.

07:40.179 --> 07:41.500
However,

07:41.500 --> 07:43.500
if given such a caning punishment,

07:43.500 --> 07:45.460
they might get seriously injured.

07:45.460 --> 07:47.979
Zishu can't bear to see these.

07:48.739 --> 07:51.020
He will surely blame me.

07:51.659 --> 07:52.659
If you care so much about

07:52.659 --> 07:54.219
what Zishu thinks,

07:54.219 --> 07:56.219
why forced him to marry
someone he does not love?

07:58.419 --> 08:00.020
If the punishment is not severe,

08:00.020 --> 08:01.580
then it's hard to establish family discipline.

08:01.580 --> 08:04.299
I'm doing this for Zishu.

08:04.299 --> 08:06.419
He's set to rise step by step.

08:06.419 --> 08:08.339
He will receive guests
more often in the future.

08:09.219 --> 08:11.020
If such accidents happen again

08:11.020 --> 08:12.900
and offend other nobles,

08:12.900 --> 08:13.979
who can protect him?

08:16.260 --> 08:18.020
Rest assured.

08:18.020 --> 08:19.659
This matter has nothing to do with you.

08:20.299 --> 08:21.739
I will make the decision.

08:27.739 --> 08:29.060
Zishu.

08:31.020 --> 08:32.580
As you say,

08:32.580 --> 08:33.900
my father, my mother and I

08:33.900 --> 08:35.699
are all guilty of negligence,

08:35.699 --> 08:36.939
should all be punished with death together.

08:38.299 --> 08:39.939
What does this have to do with you?

08:39.939 --> 08:42.100
It was you who protected me
when I was in danger.

08:42.100 --> 08:43.419
I took it all to heart.

08:43.419 --> 08:45.459
Whether to kill or to punish,
you would never be involved.

08:45.459 --> 08:46.916
Get up.

08:47.500 --> 08:48.539
Even if they are at fault,

08:49.340 --> 08:50.340
still people of the Liu Mansion.

08:51.100 --> 08:52.500
Whether to lightly punish

08:52.500 --> 08:53.779
or severely deal with,

08:53.779 --> 08:55.659
whether to beat them or execute them,

08:56.260 --> 08:57.659
are all matters of the Liu family.

08:58.340 --> 09:00.179
How can we trouble guests on this?

09:04.779 --> 09:06.380
Zishu.

09:06.380 --> 09:08.459
You never used to talk to me like this.

09:09.140 --> 09:10.620
I'm doing it for you.

09:12.740 --> 09:13.939
But Youzhen

09:14.659 --> 09:15.819
would never

09:15.819 --> 09:17.819
take the lives of half the people
in my Liu Mansion with just one sentence,

09:19.980 --> 09:22.900
and force my mother, past fifty, to kneel down.

09:24.299 --> 09:26.179
Your Highness is doing it for you.

09:26.179 --> 09:27.659
How can you fail

09:27.659 --> 09:29.100
her kindness?

09:29.659 --> 09:31.500
Think it over.

09:34.980 --> 09:36.939
If you don't like me
meddling in your family affairs,

09:37.500 --> 09:39.380
then I won't, okay?

09:40.100 --> 09:41.819
Get up.

09:41.819 --> 09:43.100
Help your mother

09:43.100 --> 09:44.260
to rise as well.

09:44.260 --> 09:45.668
Your Highness, you are generous.

09:46.740 --> 09:48.140
Zishu.

09:48.140 --> 09:49.459
Don't be willful.

09:57.539 --> 09:59.100
- Thank you, Your Highness.
- Thank you, Your Highness.

10:08.020 --> 10:09.140
Zishu.

10:09.140 --> 10:10.380
is so into studying,

10:10.939 --> 10:13.699
and he's long forgotten
how to speak with women.

10:14.419 --> 10:15.860
Your Highness,

10:15.860 --> 10:17.819
please forgive his blunt words.

10:19.059 --> 10:20.140
Your Highness pardons you all.

10:20.699 --> 10:22.459
Hurry and kowtow, then leave.

10:23.299 --> 10:24.620
Your Highness, thank you so much.

10:28.579 --> 10:30.100
I'll take my leave.

10:55.419 --> 10:57.299
I can't bear to see you frown.

11:19.659 --> 11:20.900
Youzhen.

11:22.299 --> 11:23.860
In a few more years,

11:23.860 --> 11:25.699
once I've succeeded in the imperial exam
and secured an official position,

11:26.500 --> 11:28.140
I will definitely propose to your father

11:28.140 --> 11:29.340
and marry you.

11:31.380 --> 11:32.779
There are many guests coming

11:32.779 --> 11:34.779
to seek my father's support.

11:34.779 --> 11:36.260
Should I also go ask my father

11:36.260 --> 11:38.140
for an official position for you?

11:38.140 --> 11:40.140
This way, you won't have
to study hard for years

11:40.140 --> 11:41.500
and can also be promoted in rank.

11:44.220 --> 11:45.620
I know you mean well.

11:46.380 --> 11:47.579
But I study

11:47.579 --> 11:49.020
for the purpose of understanding principles

11:49.020 --> 11:50.539
and improving myself.

11:50.539 --> 11:53.620
I wish to serve the imperial court
with my talent and knowledge,

11:54.419 --> 11:56.699
instead of climbing ranks by relying on others.

11:57.779 --> 11:59.140
I see.

11:59.140 --> 12:02.100
You have lofty ambitions and are knowledgeable,

12:03.020 --> 12:05.779
surpassing those dandies who rely on

12:05.779 --> 12:06.939
their family background.

12:11.500 --> 12:14.819
One day, you'll surely top the imperial examine
and be appointed to the highest official rank.

12:18.579 --> 12:20.140
Let me tie it for you.

12:20.140 --> 12:21.668
Okay.

12:31.220 --> 12:32.659
I have a gift for you.

12:45.059 --> 12:46.819
I hope to be with my beloved,

12:46.819 --> 12:47.939
never apart in life or death.

12:56.620 --> 12:59.340
County Princess is my beloved daughter,

13:00.100 --> 13:01.539
regarded as the Second-Rank,

13:01.539 --> 13:02.779
honored and noble.

13:03.620 --> 13:04.939
She has been living in wealth since childhood,

13:04.939 --> 13:06.220
and has never suffered the slightest

13:06.220 --> 13:07.459
grievance or neglect.

13:08.459 --> 13:10.900
With your Liu family's rank and status,

13:12.140 --> 13:13.539
how could you possibly match her?

13:14.459 --> 13:16.980
And how could you take good care of her?

13:18.380 --> 13:19.980
Please go back.

13:19.980 --> 13:22.340
Father, as long as I'm with Zishu,

13:22.340 --> 13:24.419
I don't care about rank and status.

13:24.419 --> 13:25.779
Your Highness.

13:25.779 --> 13:27.140
I hereby swear

13:28.059 --> 13:29.740
I will never let Youzhen suffer the slightest.

13:30.500 --> 13:32.220
And I will cherish and value her

13:32.220 --> 13:33.220
as a treasure.

13:34.059 --> 13:35.419
Please agree.

13:36.299 --> 13:37.419
Please agree.

13:39.179 --> 13:40.699
Take County Princess back to her room.

13:40.699 --> 13:41.892
Yes.

13:43.539 --> 13:45.579
- Your Highness.
- Zishu.

13:45.579 --> 13:46.900
Zishu.

13:46.900 --> 13:48.164
Your Highness.

13:48.164 --> 13:50.220
- Zishu.
- Youzhen.

13:50.220 --> 13:53.340
Zishu.

13:58.059 --> 13:59.620
Once you were

14:00.500 --> 14:01.659
my Youzhen,

14:03.140 --> 14:06.419
not the same as those high-handed noble ladies.

14:08.179 --> 14:09.604
But just now,

14:11.020 --> 14:12.819
you became the County Princess Ji'an.

14:13.699 --> 14:15.100
Your demeanor and words

14:15.819 --> 14:17.260
all made me feel so strange.

14:18.779 --> 14:21.020
I am always Youzhen before you.

14:22.179 --> 14:23.539
I did that

14:24.140 --> 14:26.020
just because I care too much about you.

14:26.020 --> 14:27.659
I'm afraid someone will hold you back.

14:29.459 --> 14:31.260
We have finally reunited.

14:31.819 --> 14:34.779
Don't let this little thing upset us, okay?

14:50.860 --> 14:52.020
You've lost weight.

14:53.659 --> 14:55.900
So the rumors are true

14:55.900 --> 14:57.220
that you are not living well.

14:59.620 --> 15:01.100
Zishu.

15:01.100 --> 15:02.779
Times have changed.

15:02.779 --> 15:04.260
Do you think about moving back to Chang'an?

15:09.939 --> 15:11.220
My father holds a minor official position,

15:12.179 --> 15:13.500
how could we go to Chang'an?

15:16.220 --> 15:17.500
I am living well.

15:17.500 --> 15:19.059
Do not trust the rumors.

15:19.059 --> 15:20.059
Don't worry about me.

15:21.740 --> 15:22.939
In this world,

15:23.459 --> 15:24.459
apart from you,

15:24.459 --> 15:26.220
who else is there for me to worry?

15:27.980 --> 15:29.299
Don't hide it from me.

15:29.900 --> 15:30.980
I know

15:30.980 --> 15:32.059
you have always kept

15:32.059 --> 15:33.579
my portrait in your room.

15:33.579 --> 15:34.860
Even after getting married,

15:35.579 --> 15:37.939
you've never spent the night
in Madam He's room.

15:39.059 --> 15:40.939
You've been alone for three years,

15:41.939 --> 15:43.779
and never betrayed our vows.

15:46.539 --> 15:48.179
I know well

15:48.179 --> 15:49.700
your sincerity.

15:52.220 --> 15:53.579
Youzhen, all this you mentioned

15:54.260 --> 15:55.980
is all privacy in my mansion.

15:56.779 --> 15:58.220
You are in Chang'an,

15:58.220 --> 15:59.939
how would you know so clearly?

16:02.179 --> 16:04.380
I've kept you in mind,

16:04.380 --> 16:05.900
so, I got to know

16:06.500 --> 16:07.900
everything about you.

16:09.579 --> 16:11.659
So, whether it is to punish my servants,

16:11.659 --> 16:12.860
or to inquire my privacy,

16:13.620 --> 16:14.860
it's all about your one sentence.

16:16.459 --> 16:18.299
County Princess Ji'an,

16:18.299 --> 16:20.299
have you ever asked for my opinion

16:20.299 --> 16:22.140
or cared about my feelings?

16:22.939 --> 16:24.140
I care about you,

16:24.140 --> 16:25.419
so I did so.

16:27.020 --> 16:28.620
I'm worried…

16:28.620 --> 16:30.699
I'm worried that you would forget about me.

16:30.699 --> 16:32.020
I'm afraid that you would be bullied

16:32.020 --> 16:33.604
and not living well.

16:42.100 --> 16:43.819
Zishu.

16:43.819 --> 16:45.699
If you don't like it,

16:45.699 --> 16:46.779
from now on,

16:46.779 --> 16:48.179
just tell me all about it yourself.

16:48.179 --> 16:49.299
Then I will stop doing so.

16:51.340 --> 16:52.620
Don't blame me, okay?

17:01.340 --> 17:02.620
No one in the Liu Mansion

17:02.620 --> 17:04.179
dares to blame you.

17:05.780 --> 17:07.100
It's getting late.

17:07.100 --> 17:09.100
I'll go help my mother prepare for the dinner,

17:09.100 --> 17:10.540
in case any mistake happens again.

17:47.419 --> 17:48.780
Good.

17:48.780 --> 17:50.148
Nice.

18:03.380 --> 18:05.459
Mr. Jiang.

18:05.459 --> 18:07.459
I will be heading to Chang'an next month.

18:07.459 --> 18:08.459
From now on,

18:08.459 --> 18:10.939
I hope you could continue to support me.

18:16.939 --> 18:18.380
The Chen family has
the backing of His Highness,

18:18.380 --> 18:19.659
and your official career is thriving.

18:19.659 --> 18:22.140
Where would you need the support
of a minor official like me?

18:23.499 --> 18:24.620
Mr. Jiang.

18:24.620 --> 18:26.179
His Highness is so powerful.

18:26.179 --> 18:27.340
The families backed by him

18:27.340 --> 18:29.060
not just my Chen family.

18:29.060 --> 18:30.100
So many names

18:30.100 --> 18:31.219
presented before His Majesty,

18:31.939 --> 18:33.060
if

18:33.060 --> 18:34.219
anyone is fortunate enough

18:34.219 --> 18:35.699
to be mentioned by you,

18:36.259 --> 18:37.499
then he would secure an official position.

18:38.860 --> 18:40.820
I get countless requests every day.

18:42.100 --> 18:44.140
And I am not wise as His Majesty,

18:44.140 --> 18:45.659
I can't remember everyone.

18:49.179 --> 18:50.340
Mr. Jiang.

18:50.340 --> 18:51.580
It was my oversight.

18:51.580 --> 18:53.380
I can't let you help me for nothing.

18:56.540 --> 18:57.659
A small token.

18:59.100 --> 19:00.644
Please accept it.

19:06.979 --> 19:08.219
Mr. Jiang.

19:08.219 --> 19:09.860
Don't you like

19:09.860 --> 19:11.300
the item in this box?

19:11.900 --> 19:15.699
The only thing I don't like is

19:15.699 --> 19:17.620
that the gift is not great enough.

19:17.620 --> 19:19.860
Are you kidding me?

19:22.780 --> 19:24.100
Such a cheap item

19:24.739 --> 19:26.419
is usually only fit for my guard.

19:28.900 --> 19:30.564
Thank you, My lord.

19:33.979 --> 19:35.219
Mr. Jiang.

19:35.219 --> 19:36.739
What a huge misunderstanding!

19:37.340 --> 19:39.780
Knowing you are liberal with money,

19:39.780 --> 19:40.860
this is

19:40.860 --> 19:43.380
just for you to give away.

19:43.380 --> 19:44.868
The real token

19:47.860 --> 19:49.188
is right here.

19:50.659 --> 19:52.620
Eight shops in the eastern market of Chang'an

19:52.620 --> 19:54.780
and a hundred mu of fertile farmland
on the outskirts of the city.

20:03.939 --> 20:05.699
Your father has taught his son well.

20:05.699 --> 20:07.019
His Majesty

20:07.019 --> 20:08.380
shall soon know it.

20:12.900 --> 20:14.060
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

20:19.060 --> 20:20.260
Pour the wine.

20:21.979 --> 20:23.659
Mr. Jiang, a small token.

20:23.659 --> 20:24.939
Please accept it.

20:24.939 --> 20:26.140
Mr. Jiang, please accept it.

20:40.019 --> 20:42.900
Stop it.

20:45.380 --> 20:46.860
Stop it now.

20:49.732 --> 20:50.780
What happened?

20:50.780 --> 20:53.140
Young Madam has suddenly left

20:53.699 --> 20:55.140
and said to go check

20:55.140 --> 20:56.699
the two shops that came with her dowry.

20:57.419 --> 20:59.179
Mudan has always been obedient.

20:59.179 --> 21:01.060
Even if she knew we sold her shops,

21:01.060 --> 21:02.100
she would not say anything.

21:03.060 --> 21:06.219
A husband's family has no right
to sell the wife's dowry. How could you…?

21:06.219 --> 21:07.340
If not,

21:07.340 --> 21:09.060
then how could we get the money
to receive the noble people?

21:09.739 --> 21:11.259
And how could we support
your future official career?

21:12.140 --> 21:13.419
Her being like this

21:13.419 --> 21:15.499
must be because she saw
our attitude towards County Princess

21:15.499 --> 21:16.499
and felt resentful.

21:17.419 --> 21:19.540
Has she recently had any quarrels with you?

21:20.499 --> 21:22.219
Not at all.

21:22.219 --> 21:24.900
That's fine then, you go ahead.

21:24.900 --> 21:25.979
I'll take some people to check it out.

21:25.979 --> 21:27.939
We must not let today's business get disturbed.

21:27.939 --> 21:29.348
Take it slow.

21:34.100 --> 21:36.219
The breakfast sent
from the Liu Mansion is so plain.

21:36.219 --> 21:37.820
I'm afraid we'll be busy,

21:37.820 --> 21:39.620
Madam, have a piece of cake to fill you up.

21:40.179 --> 21:41.179
After the divorce,

21:41.179 --> 21:43.140
we still need to rely on these two shops.

21:43.140 --> 21:44.380
Without resolving this matter properly,

21:44.380 --> 21:46.019
how can I have any appetite to eat?

21:46.019 --> 21:47.259
After you get divorced,

21:47.259 --> 21:48.540
the He family will take care of you.

21:48.540 --> 21:50.219
No need to operate the shops.

21:50.219 --> 21:51.820
Be careful.

21:51.820 --> 21:53.300
After mother passed away,

21:53.300 --> 21:55.340
my stepmother managed the family.

21:55.340 --> 21:56.380
I don't want to be looked down

21:56.380 --> 21:57.580
by her and younger brother.

21:57.580 --> 21:59.699
And I don't want to see my father in a pickle.

22:00.780 --> 22:01.780
I plan to sell one of two shops

22:01.780 --> 22:03.300
that came as my dowry

22:03.300 --> 22:04.699
and procure some property.

22:04.699 --> 22:06.900
And I personally operate the other shop.

22:08.459 --> 22:09.939
At the very least,

22:09.939 --> 22:11.860
mother has a garden in Chang'an.

22:11.860 --> 22:13.459
We could go there

22:13.459 --> 22:14.540
and live,

22:14.540 --> 22:15.780
being self-sufficient

22:15.780 --> 22:17.060
and living at ease.

22:17.060 --> 22:18.459
No matter what you wish to do,

22:18.459 --> 22:19.540
I will always be with you.

22:21.100 --> 22:23.620
You've loved the rose steamed cakes.

22:23.620 --> 22:24.860
Eat some,

22:24.860 --> 22:26.019
so you can

22:26.019 --> 22:27.419
help me mess up the Liu family's business.

22:28.100 --> 22:29.380
After we're done,

22:29.380 --> 22:30.564
let's eat together.

22:31.259 --> 22:32.620
Be careful.

22:32.620 --> 22:33.892
Mudan.

22:35.699 --> 22:37.124
Mudan.

22:37.979 --> 22:38.980
Come on.

22:43.860 --> 22:45.140
Father.

22:45.140 --> 22:46.219
Why are you here?

22:46.939 --> 22:48.620
I wanted to ask you.

22:48.620 --> 22:50.459
Why aren't you staying at home

22:50.459 --> 22:51.580
but hanging around here?

22:52.860 --> 22:54.140
Mother asked me

22:54.140 --> 22:55.860
to help my husband
settle matters in the officialdom.

22:56.459 --> 22:58.780
I have two shops in my dowry.

22:58.780 --> 23:01.340
Today I thought I'd come and check

23:01.340 --> 23:03.300
if I could arrange some funds.

23:04.219 --> 23:06.860
I have already dealt with it.

23:06.860 --> 23:08.900
So you don't have to worry about it.

23:08.900 --> 23:10.212
Go back.

23:11.939 --> 23:14.259
If the family needs money in the future,

23:14.259 --> 23:16.380
we will always need these two shops.

23:16.380 --> 23:17.580
Father, don't be courteous.

23:18.300 --> 23:20.179
I told you no.

23:20.780 --> 23:22.499
If you don't want to go back,

23:23.060 --> 23:25.060
then I'll have someone take you back.

23:26.540 --> 23:29.060
My lady wants to check her own dowry.

23:29.060 --> 23:30.540
Why do you refuse?

23:30.540 --> 23:31.580
How bold you are!

23:31.580 --> 23:32.699
You have no right to speak here.

23:35.219 --> 23:36.459
You obstructed me like this,

23:37.380 --> 23:38.820
is there something you want to hide?

23:41.380 --> 23:42.939
A woman should be

23:42.939 --> 23:44.459
gentle and compliant.

23:44.459 --> 23:46.300
Just listen to whatever
your husband's family says.

23:46.300 --> 23:47.900
Don't ask questions.

23:49.580 --> 23:51.300
I don't want to defy you.

23:53.019 --> 23:54.219
It's about my dowry,

23:55.019 --> 23:56.100
and I have to go.

23:56.100 --> 23:57.659
Stop her.

23:57.659 --> 23:58.900
My lady, just go.

23:58.900 --> 24:00.100
I'll hold them off here.

24:00.739 --> 24:02.179
My lady, go.

24:02.179 --> 24:04.499
Move!

24:04.499 --> 24:07.340
Hurry, My lady.

24:07.340 --> 24:09.340
- Hurry and stop Young Madam.
- Go stop Young Madam.

24:09.340 --> 24:10.419
Stop Young Madam.

24:11.459 --> 24:12.459
Move!

24:13.540 --> 24:14.620
Move!

24:14.620 --> 24:15.820
My lady.

24:17.979 --> 24:19.380
Someone has fallen into the water!

24:20.259 --> 24:21.540
Someone has fallen into the water!

24:21.540 --> 24:22.900
Come save her!

24:32.516 --> 24:33.580
Yulu.

24:33.580 --> 24:34.979
Anyone who can swim?

24:34.979 --> 24:38.219
- Hurry, save her!
- Somebody, save her!

24:38.219 --> 24:39.659
I can't swim, Master.

24:40.340 --> 24:41.956
I can't either.

24:44.300 --> 24:45.956
Yulu!

24:47.716 --> 24:48.979
Crazy!

24:48.979 --> 24:50.780
Let go of me.

24:50.780 --> 24:51.940
Let go.

24:53.300 --> 24:55.060
Liu Chang, I'm begging you.

24:55.060 --> 24:56.259
Please save Yulu.

24:56.259 --> 24:58.419
I'm begging you, please save Yulu.

24:58.419 --> 24:59.419
- Save her.
- Yes.

25:02.459 --> 25:03.620
Yulu.

25:05.580 --> 25:06.580
Yulu.

25:07.259 --> 25:08.380
She's been saved.

25:15.340 --> 25:16.620
You don't go and keep County Princess company.

25:16.620 --> 25:17.620
What are you doing here?

25:18.580 --> 25:20.939
After all, Madam He is my wife in name.

25:20.939 --> 25:23.340
If she has made a mistake,
it should be me to discipline her.

25:23.340 --> 25:24.340
I wouldn't dare trouble you, Father.

25:27.620 --> 25:28.900
Wake up.

25:30.259 --> 25:31.460
Yulu.

25:32.179 --> 25:34.860
Wake up, Yulu.

25:37.092 --> 25:38.300
Yulu.

25:38.300 --> 25:39.459
Young Madam.

25:39.459 --> 25:40.699
- Yulu.
- Yulu has stopped breathing.

25:41.860 --> 25:43.580
Call the physician now.

25:43.580 --> 25:45.179
It's too late now.

25:45.179 --> 25:46.179
It's not too late.

25:48.100 --> 25:49.179
Medical books said

25:50.380 --> 25:51.820
putting two dan of stove ash

25:51.820 --> 25:53.219
into the body from head to toe,

25:53.739 --> 25:55.459
then water will come out of all seven orifices,

25:55.459 --> 25:57.499
and the person who has drowned will be saved.

25:58.300 --> 25:59.419
It certainly works.

26:00.019 --> 26:01.412
Go.

26:02.140 --> 26:03.699
Go!

26:03.699 --> 26:05.259
Young Madam.

26:05.259 --> 26:06.820
It really is too late.

26:06.820 --> 26:09.019
Yulu has already gone.

26:24.699 --> 26:26.100
Father.

26:26.100 --> 26:27.340
Please save Yulu.

26:27.900 --> 26:32.659
I'm begging you.

26:32.659 --> 26:34.060
Please save Yulu.

26:34.060 --> 26:35.580
I'll do whatever you want me to do.

26:35.580 --> 26:38.380
I'm begging you, Father.

26:45.140 --> 26:46.340
Liu Chang.

26:46.340 --> 26:48.060
Liu Chang, please save Yulu.

26:48.699 --> 26:50.620
I'll do whatever you say.

26:50.620 --> 26:51.620
I'm begging you.

26:51.620 --> 26:53.060
Please save Yulu.

26:53.060 --> 26:54.100
I'm begging you.

26:54.100 --> 26:55.699
- Please. save Yulu.
- Get up.

26:55.699 --> 26:57.019
- Please save Yulu.
- She has stopped breathing.

26:57.019 --> 26:58.692
I'm begging you.

27:00.620 --> 27:01.699
She hasn't.

27:02.739 --> 27:04.100
She hasn't gone.

27:17.860 --> 27:19.739
Yulu.

27:19.739 --> 27:20.739
Yulu, don't scare me.

27:20.739 --> 27:21.764
Yulu.

27:23.300 --> 27:24.659
Yulu.

27:24.659 --> 27:26.140
Don't scare me.

27:26.939 --> 27:30.340
Please don't scare me.

27:32.100 --> 27:34.060
Please don't scare me. I'm begging you.

27:35.300 --> 27:36.452
Please.

27:37.860 --> 27:40.300
Please wake up, okay?

27:42.019 --> 27:43.540
We had agreed…

27:44.179 --> 27:45.419
We had agreed

27:46.780 --> 27:48.419
to go eat steamed cakes together.

27:49.179 --> 27:51.459
We agreed to be live at ease.

27:52.300 --> 27:55.219
Please wake up, okay?

28:00.259 --> 28:02.820
Say something, Yulu.

28:10.019 --> 28:11.860
Mudan.

28:11.860 --> 28:13.060
I didn't mean

28:13.060 --> 28:15.060
for this to happen.

28:15.580 --> 28:17.219
How about this?

28:17.219 --> 28:19.259
I will deduct three months' wages
from the steward

28:19.259 --> 28:20.259
as a warning to others.

28:20.860 --> 28:22.499
Do not act rashly anymore.

28:23.060 --> 28:24.179
If you hurt Young Madam,

28:24.179 --> 28:25.259
can you afford to compensate?

28:28.380 --> 28:29.939
Furthermore,

28:29.939 --> 28:31.540
Yulu was resisting,

28:31.540 --> 28:32.540
then the accident happened.

28:33.340 --> 28:35.820
If you didn't defy against
your husband's family,

28:35.820 --> 28:37.459
how could Yulu die?

28:38.499 --> 28:39.499
Don't be willful anymore.

28:40.140 --> 28:41.939
Be well-behaved.

28:41.939 --> 28:43.019
I'll

28:43.019 --> 28:45.300
find you a better maid then.

28:58.699 --> 29:00.132
Mudan.

29:00.739 --> 29:02.699
Why do so for a maid?

29:03.380 --> 29:04.900
Hurry back to freshen up.

29:04.900 --> 29:05.900
Don't catch a cold.

29:21.979 --> 29:23.699
She is not my maid.

29:26.300 --> 29:27.900
She is my sister.

29:46.499 --> 29:47.812
Yulu.

29:50.019 --> 29:51.019
Let's go home.

29:53.780 --> 29:55.140
Go home.

30:01.764 --> 30:03.780
[The Tomb of Yulu]

30:03.780 --> 30:05.659
Whenever I make mistakes out of playfulness,

30:06.739 --> 30:08.659
grandmother would punish me
by not allowing me to eat.

30:09.540 --> 30:10.979
But you

30:10.979 --> 30:12.620
would always steal some snacks for me.

30:15.219 --> 30:17.140
And,

30:17.140 --> 30:18.340
you would

30:19.300 --> 30:20.580
always get caught,

30:21.739 --> 30:24.659
then spanked on the palm.

30:29.979 --> 30:31.044
Yulu.

30:32.939 --> 30:34.019
I still remember

30:34.860 --> 30:37.620
after the Qiongtai Yulu was first cultivated,

30:38.860 --> 30:41.259
and when you learned that my mother and I

30:41.259 --> 30:43.219
named it after you,

30:43.939 --> 30:45.219
you were delighted for a long time.

30:48.140 --> 30:49.780
But you didn't get to wait

30:49.780 --> 30:51.259
the Qiongtai Yulu bloom.

30:53.336 --> 30:56.140
[The Tomb of Yulu]

30:56.140 --> 30:57.340
Since childhood,

30:59.659 --> 31:01.179
you have always worried about me,

31:03.060 --> 31:04.620
fearing that I would not live well.

31:06.620 --> 31:08.499
When the Liu family bullied me,

31:10.499 --> 31:12.140
you were even angrier than I was.

31:16.699 --> 31:18.212
Yulu.

31:20.499 --> 31:22.060
From now on,

31:24.540 --> 31:26.419
you don't have to worry about me anymore.

31:54.060 --> 31:55.588
Yulu.

31:56.580 --> 31:58.052
Rest assured.

32:00.140 --> 32:01.900
I won't force myself again.

32:05.699 --> 32:06.739
[Women's Precepts]
I once thought

32:07.620 --> 32:09.060
to conceal my edge

32:09.060 --> 32:10.499
would allow me to live at ease.

32:11.380 --> 32:13.060
In the end,

32:13.060 --> 32:14.459
I couldn't even protect

32:14.459 --> 32:15.699
the closest one to me.

32:19.419 --> 32:20.499
No matter how difficult,

32:21.900 --> 32:23.300
from now on,

32:24.100 --> 32:25.380
I will live as I please.

32:26.499 --> 32:28.219
I will become back

32:29.300 --> 32:30.540
to the carefree

32:31.419 --> 32:32.659
He Weifang.

32:44.219 --> 32:45.636
This way.

32:55.219 --> 32:56.620
Mudan.

32:56.620 --> 32:58.300
What are you doing?

32:58.300 --> 32:59.580
We are all family.

32:59.580 --> 33:01.140
Why make it seem like
we're dividing the family?

33:02.499 --> 33:03.620
In just one year,

33:03.620 --> 33:04.979
I've been deceived and cheated,

33:04.979 --> 33:06.340
and my dowry has reduced by more than half.

33:06.979 --> 33:08.540
Is this what you call a family?

33:11.300 --> 33:14.019
Mudan, have you misunderstood something?

33:14.019 --> 33:16.620
County Princess and Floral Envoy have come.

33:16.620 --> 33:17.820
Many gold and jade ornaments,

33:17.820 --> 33:20.100
antique calligraphy and paintings in your dowry

33:20.100 --> 33:21.179
are just temporarily

33:21.179 --> 33:22.900
placed in their room.

33:22.900 --> 33:24.939
Sooner or later, they will be put into storage.

33:25.900 --> 33:29.380
Everything should prioritize the Liu family.

33:29.380 --> 33:30.699
Why be so calculating?

33:31.659 --> 33:32.699
Yes, Young Madam.

33:33.259 --> 33:36.259
You can't snatch with them.

33:38.019 --> 33:39.620
Why can't I be calculating?

33:39.620 --> 33:40.820
Those are mine.

33:40.820 --> 33:42.860
Let me ask you. Why can't I be calculating?

33:48.140 --> 33:50.019
The two nobles are just staying
at the Liu Mansion temporarily.

33:51.060 --> 33:52.780
No matter how noble they are,

33:52.780 --> 33:54.019
they shouldn't take what I cherish.

33:55.459 --> 33:56.820
If you wish to flatter others,

33:56.820 --> 33:58.140
I don't care.

33:58.140 --> 33:59.780
But I

33:59.780 --> 34:01.140
won't let others manipulate me.

34:03.860 --> 34:05.659
Liu Chang.

34:05.659 --> 34:07.380
You pride yourself on being a scholar.

34:07.380 --> 34:09.099
In the past, you deemed yourself
as the most lofty.

34:09.700 --> 34:10.740
Are you also willing

34:10.740 --> 34:12.419
to use a woman's dowry

34:12.419 --> 34:13.900
to pave your way to success?

34:13.900 --> 34:15.619
Mudan, you…

34:15.619 --> 34:17.019
I did not know before

34:17.019 --> 34:18.419
that they were your dowry.

34:19.180 --> 34:20.660
Had I known,

34:20.660 --> 34:22.372
I would never have touched it.

34:24.660 --> 34:26.380
Go get the furnishings from the guest room.

34:27.619 --> 34:29.780
Zishu,

34:29.780 --> 34:31.539
I'm afraid County Princess will be displeased.

34:31.539 --> 34:33.459
Mother, Mudan is right.

34:34.260 --> 34:36.180
How to deal with
the belongings of the Liu Mansion

34:36.180 --> 34:37.820
is not something outsiders to criticize.

34:40.340 --> 34:41.924
Go now.

34:55.780 --> 34:57.499
Apart from the items in the storage,

34:57.499 --> 34:59.900
there are also the two shops
that were sold previously.

34:59.900 --> 35:01.740
I hope you could return them all together.

35:02.340 --> 35:03.700
Without my permission,

35:04.260 --> 35:05.740
anyone in the Liu Mansion

35:05.740 --> 35:07.260
can't touch my belongings again.

35:08.700 --> 35:10.099
Mudan.

35:10.099 --> 35:12.180
Why are you like this today?

35:12.740 --> 35:13.979
Being so calculating

35:13.979 --> 35:15.099
and seeking money.

35:15.099 --> 35:16.340
You are not like an official's family.

35:20.099 --> 35:21.700
I've been like this.

35:22.499 --> 35:24.300
But you all have come to know it today.

35:51.220 --> 35:52.996
Mr. Jiang.

35:54.419 --> 35:55.876
Wait.

35:59.180 --> 36:00.740
Why is this jade on you?

36:04.979 --> 36:06.459
Chen Zhang gave it to me.

36:07.260 --> 36:08.459
I found its quality to be decent,

36:08.459 --> 36:10.180
so I gave it to Chuanyu.

36:10.180 --> 36:12.539
As for where Chen Zhang got it from,

36:13.419 --> 36:15.019
I'm afraid you'll have to ask Master Liu.

36:21.820 --> 36:23.700
Mr. Jiang.

36:23.700 --> 36:25.260
This was mine.

36:25.780 --> 36:26.939
Could you

36:27.700 --> 36:28.700
sell it back to me?

36:30.499 --> 36:31.780
You are a stingy person,

36:32.419 --> 36:33.820
are you willing to spend money

36:33.820 --> 36:35.260
to buy back what was yours?

36:36.979 --> 36:38.380
Someone from the Liu family
gave it to someone else

36:38.380 --> 36:39.380
without letting me know.

36:40.459 --> 36:41.619
It has nothing to do with you.

36:42.139 --> 36:44.180
I have no reason to make you bear this loss.

36:46.180 --> 36:47.459
You are quite reasonable.

36:48.499 --> 36:49.979
However,

36:49.979 --> 36:51.780
I have already given this jade to Chuanyu.

36:52.380 --> 36:53.900
Whether it is to be sold or kept,

36:53.900 --> 36:55.820
you should ask him.

36:55.820 --> 36:57.444
I…

37:00.019 --> 37:01.019
This item was a birthday gift

37:01.019 --> 37:02.619
from me to Yulu.

37:03.340 --> 37:05.099
Now, somehow,

37:05.099 --> 37:06.180
it has ended up in your hands.

37:07.900 --> 37:09.260
To me, Yulu

37:10.099 --> 37:11.459
is like my younger sister.

37:13.579 --> 37:14.820
Now that she's gone,

37:15.380 --> 37:16.836
I just want to

37:18.180 --> 37:19.700
take this item to remember her by.

37:21.459 --> 37:23.340
Well,

37:23.340 --> 37:25.380
the quality of my jade is even better.

37:25.380 --> 37:26.619
I am willing to exchange this jade

37:26.619 --> 37:27.979
to get back yours, how about it?

37:31.499 --> 37:32.939
This was your item.

37:32.939 --> 37:34.139
I should give it back to you.

37:34.139 --> 37:35.380
You can keep it.

37:35.380 --> 37:36.459
No way.

37:36.459 --> 37:38.820
You take this. Take it.

37:38.820 --> 37:40.660
My lord.

37:40.660 --> 37:42.220
My lord always gets bribe.

37:42.220 --> 37:43.419
And he gives me many things.

37:43.419 --> 37:45.099
This one item won't make a difference.

37:45.099 --> 37:46.979
My lord treats me very well.

37:47.539 --> 37:49.619
I know how close

37:49.619 --> 37:50.860
you and Yulu were.

37:50.860 --> 37:52.019
I can feel what you feel.

37:52.019 --> 37:53.860
If I were to accept your jade,

37:53.860 --> 37:55.979
my lord would surely look down on me.

38:03.780 --> 38:04.820
Regarding Yulu,

38:07.059 --> 38:08.772
please accept my condolences.

38:28.459 --> 38:29.860
Thank you.

38:38.260 --> 38:40.036
Mr. Jiang.

38:47.019 --> 38:48.380
Could you keep this jade

38:49.660 --> 38:51.419
and return it to me tomorrow?

38:59.260 --> 39:00.676
Yes.

39:07.340 --> 39:09.028
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

39:13.740 --> 39:15.419
What does she mean?

39:15.419 --> 39:17.156
What is she going to do tomorrow?

39:18.260 --> 39:20.459
Just wait and watch the play.

39:26.700 --> 39:28.180
Why is the rabbit so fierce?

39:28.180 --> 39:29.380
It bites.

39:29.380 --> 39:30.459
What are you afraid of?

39:30.459 --> 39:31.900
No matter how fierce, it's still a rabbit.

39:31.900 --> 39:33.300
Just soothe it by stroking its fur.

39:52.019 --> 39:53.668
County Princess.

39:57.180 --> 39:59.300
I've told Zishu before

39:59.300 --> 40:01.660
I like fluffy things.

40:01.660 --> 40:03.579
I didn't expect after such a long time,

40:03.579 --> 40:05.252
he still remembers it.

40:07.220 --> 40:08.820
Please thank Zishu.

40:08.820 --> 40:10.059
Bring the rabbit over.

40:15.900 --> 40:16.939
It's for Young Madam?

40:18.260 --> 40:19.260
Yes.

40:25.099 --> 40:26.300
My lord.

40:26.300 --> 40:27.660
I am incompetent.

40:27.660 --> 40:28.860
The rabbit bit me

40:29.419 --> 40:30.579
and it ran away.

40:30.579 --> 40:32.324
It ran away?

40:38.019 --> 40:39.820
Then what's with the blood on you?

40:42.260 --> 40:44.059
My lord, please forgive me.

40:44.059 --> 40:45.380
Qiushi, I'm asking you a question.

40:45.380 --> 40:46.852
Answer me.

40:48.579 --> 40:49.900
It was County Princess.

40:49.900 --> 40:51.180
She saw the rabbit,

40:51.180 --> 40:52.619
realizing it wasn't for her.

40:52.619 --> 40:54.180
Then County Princess asked me

40:54.180 --> 40:55.939
to kill the rabbit.

40:55.939 --> 40:57.459
County Princess asked you

40:57.459 --> 40:58.939
to kill the rabbit?

41:10.019 --> 41:12.019
Tell County Princess

41:12.019 --> 41:13.260
that she's still in her mourning period.

41:13.260 --> 41:15.059
I fear others will gossip about her.

41:15.860 --> 41:18.099
I won't go boating on the lake tonight.

41:19.380 --> 41:20.459
You may leave.

41:20.459 --> 41:21.796
Yes.

41:29.939 --> 41:31.260
Three years have passed.

41:33.660 --> 41:34.900
People have changed.

41:36.740 --> 41:38.180
Well,

41:38.180 --> 41:40.419
Zishu not going boating with me

41:41.260 --> 41:42.579
is for me,

41:43.660 --> 41:45.099
or for that Madam He?

41:45.780 --> 41:47.579
Madam He is nothing.

41:47.579 --> 41:49.380
Mr. Liu never cares about her.

41:49.939 --> 41:51.419
Your Highness, please don't overthink it.

41:53.499 --> 41:56.059
If he never cared about her,

41:57.180 --> 41:58.700
why would he give her a rabbit then?

42:20.577 --> 42:26.851
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:28.705 --> 42:35.389
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:36.065 --> 42:43.263
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:44.257 --> 42:52.609
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:52.609 --> 43:00.152
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

43:00.806 --> 43:08.993
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

43:08.993 --> 43:16.804
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

43:17.409 --> 43:24.701
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:45.377 --> 43:52.260
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:53.561 --> 44:00.255
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the fragrant garden ♫

44:01.012 --> 44:08.314
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

44:08.998 --> 44:17.307
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

44:17.307 --> 44:24.738
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

44:25.569 --> 44:33.825
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:33.825 --> 44:41.249
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

44:42.253 --> 44:49.703
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
